# Docker builds run from the repo root (apps use workspace packages). Only what they need goes in: the workspace's
# files, and each app with the workspace packages it uses (add one here when an app starts using it)
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!turbo.json
!apps/studio-web
!packages/visualiser
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
apps/studio-web/build
apps/studio-web/tests
